      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "So you want to throw a bomb at something a thousand blocks away. Welcome to the ICBM program. A GregGuns missile is not one crafting recipe: it\u0027s a §lMissile Body§r and a §lWarhead§r, built separately from GregTech parts and Galacticraft rocket hardware, then stacked on a launch pad and fired from a Launch Control.\n\nThis chapter walks the Tier 1 build part by part, the way the [quest]Space Race[/quest] tab walks the Tier 1 rocket. Start by stocking the materials almost every part shares. Advanced circuits go into the Missile Chip (2), the Guidance Computer (1), the Fuze Assembly (1) and the Launch Control (2). Stainless steel plates are the warhead casing, and steel plates go into the computer and the fuze. Nothing in the ICBM program runs below HV, so your HV Assembler and Circuit Assembler will be busy.\n\nThen work through the part quests below: chip and schematic, compressed plates, fins, engine and guidance for the body, a fuze for the warhead. Check NEI on every part.\n\n[note]The ICBM chapter needs Galacticraft and the ICBM module (config modules.icbm). If you already hold a finished Missile Body T1, the body\u0027s part quests complete themselves.[/note]",
